OL,3,GNEWSAExtra police patrols deployed for
OL,4,Asecond weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra police patrols will be deployed
OL,7,Fin a Surrey town for the second
OL,8,Fconsecutive weekend after repeated
OL,9,Freports of anti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FA dispersal order will take effect
OL,12,Facross Horley town centre at 17:00 GMT
OL,13,Fon Friday and last until 17:00 on
OL,14,FSunday, Surrey Police says.
OL,16,FThe order grants officers powers to
OL,17,Fdirect people to leave the area if they
OL,18,Fhave, or are likely to, be a nuisance,
OL,19,Fcommit a crime or cause disorder.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
