OL,3,GNEWSAExtra police patrols deployed for
OL,4,Asecond weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra patrols and a dispersal order
OL,7,Fwere also in place between 20 and 22
OL,8,FNovember in Horley, which the force
OL,9,Fsaid was due to "reports of anti-social
OL,10,Fbehaviour involving youths".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
